          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bapati baŋanda yakwe bakabuka kuzoomubusya ansi mpaakalede, pele wakakaka, teewakalya abo insima pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela mubuzuba bwamusanu aabili mwana wakafwa, elyo balanda ba-Davida bakayoowa kumuzibya makani aalufu lwamwana, nkaambo bakaamba kuti, Mwana naakali muumi, wakakaka kuswiilila majwi esu ciindi ncitwakamwaambila, lino na twamwaambila kuti mwana wafwa, ulaindila kubijilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakabona kuti balanda bakwe balapetekezya, aboobo wakamvwa kuti mwana wafwa. Lino Davida wakabuzya balanda bakwe kuti, Wafwa na mwana? Bakati, Ii, wafwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
