        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakaumbulizya mukakwe Bateseba, nkabela wakaya nkwaakabede akulala awe. Elyo wakazyala mwana, wakamuulika izina lya-Solomoni. Nkabela Jehova wakamuyanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
